# Consumed by the Presenton startup step (see README "Run Presenton" section) --
# Presenton's own launch command sources this file specifically for the LLM
# provider key, alongside Presenton's own .env in its separate clone.
#
# Any provider Presenton supports works; this project was built and verified
# against OpenRouter with Claude Sonnet 5.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
